   411	    def on_fit_start(self):
   412	        """Announce the treatment once, on rank 0, before step 0.
   413	
   414	        The launch kit greps the job log for this line and kills a run that does
   415	        not print it: exp_15's whole contrast is "this arm was augmented, the
