   122	    ``noise -> (z - lambda*A(p))`` instead of ``noise -> z``. That is the arm's
   123	    OBJECTIVE, so it has to be a declared, checkpoint-embedded property rather
   124	    than an ambient constant — the same reasoning announcement 06 applies to the
   125	    frame-average chunk plan.
