   127	    Returns ``{}`` unless ``are_lambda`` is present, so an arm that does not
   128	    declare it is constructed through the LITERAL pre-change call. That matters
   129	    concretely here: exp_16's lambda=0 control is P1, a run that already
   130	    happened, and the comparison is only clean if the absent-key path is
   131	    byte-identical to the one P1 was trained through.
