   319	    """``''`` / ``'_are0'`` / ``'_are0p5'`` / ``'_are1'`` — the lambda's filename token.
   320	
   321	    Empty for a non-ARE run, so every legacy artifact name is byte-identical.
   322	    Non-empty otherwise, because AR3 evaluates ONE checkpoint at three lambdas and
   323	    they must not overwrite one another's metrics file.
   324	    """
   325	    return '' if are_lambda is None else '_are' + rot_token(are_lambda)
