   962	    INSIDE the metrics dict under ``by_scene``. The record keeps ``metrics`` flat
   963	    and numeric -- every existing consumer reads ``record["metrics"][key]`` as a
   964	    number, and the exp_11 row validator pins that key set exactly -- so the map
   965	    is lifted out here and recorded beside it instead.
