   428	def test_draws_are_resume_exact():
   429	    """The property the counter-based scheme exists for (plan §3.1, review F5).
   430	
   431	    A run killed at step N and resumed there must make exactly the draws the
   432	    uninterrupted run would have made: there is no stream state to checkpoint,
   433	    only the (seed, step, rank) counter, which the resumed process rebuilds from
