   457	# §6.5-4 factory parsing of training.yaw_aug (+ its fail-closed guards)
   458	# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
   459	# The wrapper kwargs the factory passed BEFORE exp_15 existed. Plan §3.3-4: with
